# NihongoStudy — Feature Suggestions & Backlog

## Active (next update)
- 1 PENDING (deciding)

- vocabulary or short sentences para sa nature ng work 
  ex. food services, Construction and Technical Skills, hospitality, Caregiving and Healthcare
      Manufacturing and Industrial, Hospitality and Service Industry, farm

## Planned (no timeline yet)
- Jisho link on kanji cards
  "More on Jisho →" opening jisho.org/search/[kanji]
  Direct value for JLPT vocabulary section

- Add user toggle preferrence for (confirmation before final answer)

- Add more kanji N5–N3
  Current: 105 kanji (N5/N4)
  Goal: full coverage N5 to N3

- Sentence pattern fill-up quiz
  Example format:
  Choose the correct particle: は / を / で / に
  私 ___ 日本食レストラン ___ 日本語 ___ 勉強しています。
  田中さん ___ 図書館 ___ 日本語 ___ 勉強しています。
  私 ___ 学校 ___ 英語 ___ 勉強しています。
  山田さん ___ カフェ ___ 日本語 ___ 勉強しています。
  私 ___ 家 ___ 日本語 ___ 勉強しています。
  Note: follow existing design, no style changes

- Listening section
  Biggest gap vs real JLPT exam structure
  JLPT has 3 sections: Language Knowledge,
  Reading, and Listening
  Current app covers first two only

## No Priority (suggested, not planned)
- Stroke order animated SVG
  Not tested in JLPT exam
  Nice to have for handwriting learners only

## Design Note
All new features must follow the current
design system. No style or layout changes
until a dedicated design update is planned.